<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-top: 6px solid #b91c1c;
      }
      .header {
        background: #b91c1c;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
      }
      .header p {
        color: #fecaca;
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .body p {
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .level-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 13px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .level-critical {
        background: #fee2e2;
        color: #991b1b;
      }
      .level-high {
        background: #fef3c7;
        color: #92400e;
      }
      .level-medium {
        background: #fef9c3;
        color: #854d0e;
      }
      .level-low {
        background: #dbeafe;
        color: #1e40af;
      }
      .info-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .info-table td {
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .info-table td:first-child {
        color: #6b7280;
        width: 40%;
      }
      .info-table td:last-child {
        color: #111827;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .reasoning-box {
        background: #fef2f2;
        border-left: 4px solid #b91c1c;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .reasoning-box p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #7f1d1d;
        font-style: italic;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #b91c1c;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        padding: 20px 30px;
        background: #f9fafb;
        text-align: center;
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Safeguarding Alert</h1>
        <p>Action Required</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>A safeguarding concern has been raised during an ESOL learner
          session. Please review and take appropriate action.</p>

        <table class="info-table">
          <tr>
            <td>Alert level</td>
            <td>
              <span class="level-tag level-{{alertLevel}}">{{alertLevel}}</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Learner</td>
            <td>{{learnerName}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Organisation</td>
            <td>{{orgName}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Session ID</td>
            <td>{{sessionId}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Raised at</td>
            <td>{{raisedAt}}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="reasoning-box">
          <p>{{reasoning}}</p>
        </div>

        <p>Review the full session in the admin dashboard:</p>
        <p style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Review in Dashboard</a>
        </p>

        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;">
          The original message content is held securely in the platform. To
          preserve learner privacy, it is not included in this email.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Amber Training. Safeguarding system.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>